=== Test 50: Shared Pointers ===
test_basic:
  Animal(1) created
  Animal(1) speaks: Rex
  leaving scope...
  Animal(1) destroyed
test_scope:
  Animal(2) created
  Animal(2) speaks: Luna
  leaving inner scope...
  Animal(2) destroyed
  back in outer scope
test_reassign:
  Animal(3) created
  Animal(3) speaks: Max
  reassigning...
  Animal(3) destroyed
  Animal(4) created
  Animal(4) speaks: Bella
  leaving scope...
  Animal(4) destroyed
test_null:
  null shared pointer OK
test_inheritance:
  Animal(5) created
  Dog(5) created
  Dog(5) barks: Buddy the Labrador
  id = 5
  leaving scope...
  Dog(5) destroyed
  Animal(5) destroyed
test_delete:
  Animal(6) created
  Animal(6) speaks: Charlie
  Animal(6) destroyed
  after delete
test_stress:
  stress sum: 499500
=== Test 50 complete ===
